# Docker
# `.dockerignore` is NOT ignored. It was, from the first Docker commit
# (2026-02-10), which is why nobody had one: every build sent the whole tree
# including a 1.4 GB node_modules the image never uses. It is a build input
# like the Dockerfile and belongs in the repository.

